WEBVTT

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:20.010
Yuufa...

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.020
My beloved sister.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.680
Ohh! Big Brother Keough!

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:34.900
My sister, I thank you.

00:00:34.900 --> 00:00:39.470
Because of you, a new world will be born.

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:42.400
There's no need for thanks.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:45.860
I only wanted to be of help to you...

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.510
Is that why you left Roan?

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:50.710
I...

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:56.890
Yuufa, girl who hungers for love...

00:00:56.890 --> 00:01:01.120
Here, you need never suffer so again.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.690
Oh, I'm so glad, Big Brother.

00:01:03.690 --> 00:01:06.030
So what should I do?

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:09.160
Merely stay here, that is all.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.150
Huh?

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:15.200
B-Big Brother!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.200
But... But...

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:25.000
Roan...

00:01:28.350 --> 00:01:30.790
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:30.790 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:37.260
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:41.760
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:47.570
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.510
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:55.540 --> 00:01:59.610
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:06.920
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:12.460
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:19.590
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:25.070
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:27.510
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:34.450
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:36.720
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:40.790
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:40.790 --> 00:02:43.290
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:47.830
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:47.830 --> 00:02:53.640
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:56.540
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:23.330
Yes, sir. I shall send you now to Prontera!

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:25.990
W-Wait! Not Prontera! Morok-k-!

00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:29.190
Huh?

00:03:48.360 --> 00:03:50.190
You became a Sage, I see.

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:55.100
Congratulations. I suppose that's what I should say...

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:59.100
Yes, I ignored your counsel.
Please forgive me.

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.770
Never mind.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:03.300
It must have come as a great shock to you...

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.970
...to see Zephyrus's true nature.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.310
True, the occurrence at Payon was a great shock to me.

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:17.980
Quagmire!

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.420
Sightrasher!

00:04:29.260 --> 00:04:32.260
Heaven's Drive!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.210
Stop...

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:40.680
Fire Pillar!

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.210
Meteor...

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.510
...Storm!

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:55.520
How wondrous.
My strength has returned.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:59.390
Life is flowing into my body.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:05:02.130
The ultimate truth is almost within my reach.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:05.600
<i>Sensei...</i>

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:08.590
Fire Wall!

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:15.640
To me, <i>Sensei</i> Zephyrus was an admirable man.

00:05:15.640 --> 00:05:18.950
At least, he was. Why?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:22.050
You were too close to Zephyrus.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:26.490
That's why you couldn't see the larger world. Also...

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:30.480
You were literally blinded from the truth.

00:05:32.260 --> 00:05:35.750
But if Zephyrus was as
Takius-<i>san</i> described, why...

00:05:37.770 --> 00:05:39.930
It happened...

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:42.060
...a very long time ago.

00:05:43.540 --> 00:05:46.800
Zephyrus was researching spells to create life.

00:05:56.350 --> 00:06:01.720
However, the experiment failed, and he lost his family because of it.

00:06:21.380 --> 00:06:26.980
In order never to cause such grief again,

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:31.620
I must find... I must find the ultimate truth.

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:34.680
What's the idea?
Getting your family killed!

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:39.090
The ultimate truth is impossible to find!

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:43.830
Save everyone? How can you do that?

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:47.000
How long will you keep up this nonsense?!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:07:00.050
Truth... truth is the only hope for saving this world and the people.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:03.050
I must do everything possible to find the ultimate truth!

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.050
Zephyrus-<i>kun...</i>

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.420
Great Wizard...

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.120
Who is it?

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.360
One who shares your hopes.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:16.200
Zephyrus-<i>kun</i>... I wish to help you.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.300
Come. Come to me.

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:37.520
And he allowed himself to be taken into the threatening waves.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:39.090
Glast Heim...

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:43.420
Let's go... to Glast Heim.
Isn't Yuufa there, too?

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.690
Yes, without a doubt.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:50.470
Ma-<i>chan</i> wants to take revenge for Alice-<i>chan</i> and Jirtas, too.

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:53.330
No, I must settle this with <i>Sensei.</i>

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:55.560
Wait!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:07:58.570
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:00.240
Please don't stop me!

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:02.940
I wasn't able to protect Yuufa.

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:06.010
I wanted the strength to protect her.

00:08:06.010 --> 00:08:07.950
But I relied too heavily on the strength I'd acquired...

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:09.620
...and forgot what was more important.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.420
Who's stopping you?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:12.590
Huh?

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:15.590
I'm going to Glast Heim, too.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:20.290
No, I must go.
That is where everything began,

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.630
and that is where everything must end.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:26.070
Iruga-<i>san...</i>

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:29.470
Even if you leave now, you will reach there at night.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:32.510
Rest today and depart tomorrow morning.

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:33.510
But...

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.910
Let's do that.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:39.640
Rest will make Iruga-<i>san</i> a little stronger. Also...

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.020
What?

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:43.810
No, nothing...

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.220
Catherine...

00:08:48.220 --> 00:08:49.890
Yes?

00:08:49.890 --> 00:08:53.690
I, too, sensed darkening waves over Glast Heim.

00:08:53.690 --> 00:08:55.730
So I did a little investigating.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:57.560
And we found out something terrible.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:05.910
Glast Heim is where a Monster called the Dark Lord was sealed.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.170
Sealed away?

00:09:07.170 --> 00:09:10.280
Yes. This was the era when
Monsters and Gods...

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:13.850
...were powerful in this world.

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:15.950
But it is written that when the world grows corrupt;

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.190
and the 7 Great Kinds of Greed fill men's hearts,

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:21.920
the Dark Lord will arise again.

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:23.560
The 7 Great Kinds of Greed?

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:33.430
Yes. Pride, Sorrow, Enmity, Jealousy,
Gluttony, Despair, and Partiality.

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:37.740
Good grief, those things are already overflowing in this world.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:39.510
Poring.

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:42.740
The Assassin Guild knew of this, didn't they?

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:43.910
That's right.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.510
My mission was to spy on Glast Heim.

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.320
Glast Heim?!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.320
That's right.
It's a dangerous trip.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:58.090
You two wait at Prontera.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:09:59.690
No! We don't want to!

00:09:59.690 --> 00:10:02.330
That's right!
We're going with you!

00:10:02.330 --> 00:10:03.490
But...

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:17.580
Okay. But if there's any trouble, you must return.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:19.210
--All right!
--All right!

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.020
But because of that,

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.850
I lost my best friend...

00:10:33.790 --> 00:10:34.960
Keough-<i>san!</i>

00:10:37.060 --> 00:10:38.160
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:40.690
Wait, Big Brother's...

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.700
Go, Yuufa! Go!

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.430
No!!

00:10:54.120 --> 00:10:56.780
If the Dark Lord has been revived,

00:10:56.780 --> 00:10:59.450
we can just seal him up again, can't we?

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.180
That wouldn't be possible.

00:11:03.220 --> 00:11:06.690
It wasn't only Humans that sealed the Dark Lord up.

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:11.060
It took Monsters and Gods working together to finally seal him up.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.490
But...

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:16.840
I'm still...

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:29.170
I'm still going there to rescue Yuufa!

00:11:50.140 --> 00:11:53.140
Okay, now you're fine.

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.130
Judia...

00:11:56.810 --> 00:11:58.050
I'm sorry.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.710
It can't be helped.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:02.320
It's what you do, the only man I ever loved.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:05.850
Can't stop you. Only...

00:12:05.850 --> 00:12:09.480
For tonight, only tonight, be my Iruga.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.350
Good-bye!

00:12:54.740 --> 00:12:58.200
Good morning.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:13.890
Takius-<i>san</i>, why are we leaving so early?

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:18.460
I'm sorry. But we can't take Maaya with us.

00:13:18.460 --> 00:13:19.630
Huh?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:24.270
That girl has a future.
We can't drag her into our fate.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.470
Huh? Oh. That's right.

00:13:26.470 --> 00:13:29.490
Don't worry. We'll do her share of fighting, too.

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:40.580
What's that?

00:13:40.580 --> 00:13:42.170
S-Save us!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:45.290
What's wrong?

00:13:45.290 --> 00:13:46.810
Th-That!

00:13:55.530 --> 00:13:57.970
Boss tried to haggle over the hotel bill!

00:13:57.970 --> 00:13:59.370
Sorry!

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:03.530
Th-Those guys just came out of nowhere.
And so many of them!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.920
Damn you!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:22.910
Arrow Shower!

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.570
Gotcha!

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.560
Aw...

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.260
Cold Bolt!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.120
Iruga!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:58.490
Bastard! You hurt my Iruga!

00:14:58.490 --> 00:14:59.760
Charge...

00:15:00.760 --> 00:15:02.230
...Arrow!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:06.460
Are you okay, Iruga?!

00:15:09.240 --> 00:15:10.570
Rats!

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:11.600
Devotion!

00:15:17.240 --> 00:15:18.740
Heaven's Drive!

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:31.460
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.450
Falco!

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.400
Thank you.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:41.560
Likewise!

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.560
That's...

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:00.190
Yuufa!

00:16:00.190 --> 00:16:01.120
Roan!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:03.690
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:06.790
Holy Cross!

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:13.930
Takius-<i>san</i>!

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.530
Poison?!

00:16:23.110 --> 00:16:24.100
Falco!

00:16:27.510 --> 00:16:28.500
Judia!

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.580
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:38.330
No!

00:16:38.330 --> 00:16:41.490
Roan, Judia-<i>san</i>, Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:47.940
Ready? Go!

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:48.930
Poring!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.100
Poring. Poring.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.510
Maaya!

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:58.980
Takius-<i>san</i>, behind you!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:03.450
Earth...

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:04.940
...Spike!

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:15.620
What the heck were they doing?

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:21.470
This is what happens when you try to leave Ma-<i>chan</i> behind. Hya!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.470
Huh? Oh?

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:30.810
Huh? Maaya-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:35.640
You can try, but you'll never leave Ma-<i>chan</i> behind.

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:40.480
Poring.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:49.500
Oh! Big Sis!

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.660
Yuufa!

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:55.170
Huh?!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:57.600
What's going on?!

00:17:57.600 --> 00:17:58.940
Poring!

00:17:58.940 --> 00:18:01.880
Yuufa-<i>san</i>, where did you send them?!

00:18:03.510 --> 00:18:06.500
To a nice place... Takius-<i>san...</i>

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:14.690
Where am I?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:17.960
This is Glast Heim, Takius-<i>kun.</i>

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.290
Zephyrus!

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:27.130
Ahh! Don't worry. Your friends are here in Glast Heim, too.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.740
Where are we?

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:38.850
Glast Heim!

00:18:38.850 --> 00:18:40.580
Where's Big Sis?

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:41.810
Yuufa!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.190
Takius is gone, too!

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:53.180
What?!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:14.150
I asked Miss Yuufa, and had her invite only you here.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:18.950
Takius-<i>kun</i>, I'll forgive you...

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.960
...for disobeying my teachings and becoming a Sage.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:25.290
If you'll become my student once more.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.460
I refuse.

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.100
Huh?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:33.900
If you killed Humans and even
Monsters to obtain your truth,

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:36.300
it can never save the world!

00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:40.810
I came here to bring peace to those who were killed...

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:42.640
...by your honeyed words!

00:19:44.850 --> 00:19:47.140
You leave me no choice.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:53.650
I hope you'll let me enjoy myself a little. If not...

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:55.650
I shall never forgive you.

00:20:00.360 --> 00:20:04.030
Using movement to avoid becoming a target?

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.730
You're naïve.

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:08.430
Quagmire!

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:15.340
Sightrasher!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:20.270
Magic Rod!

00:20:31.890 --> 00:20:35.230
I was right to bring you here.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:41.360
Here, we can play to our hearts' content. Right, Takius-<i>kun</i>?!

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:46.570
Reflect...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.840
...Shield!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.250
Double Strafing!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:00.120
Sonic Blow!

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:04.160
Iruga!

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:05.490
You dirty...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.150
Holy Cross!

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:19.310
Are you all right, Iruga?!

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:20.510
Y-Yeah...

00:21:20.510 --> 00:21:22.080
We did it!

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:23.240
R-Right...

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:35.450
Keough!

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:38.690
I shall have to thank you.

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:39.860
What?!

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:43.460
Because I got this from them.

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:46.460
But I cannot kill my friends.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:54.900
Oops. Or do Humans have a patent on betraying their friends?

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:57.210
Where's Yuufa?!

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:02.320
Sleeping Beauty awaits her prince's kiss within.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:03.480
Hurry to her.

00:22:04.650 --> 00:22:05.620
Only...

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.990
If you can get past me alive!

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:26.400
Here I come, Takius-<i>kun.</i>
Are you prepared to die?

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:44.850
<i>Unable to even find a way</i> <i>to regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.830 --> 00:22:53.930
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:53.930 --> 00:22:58.770
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:03.640
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.640 --> 00:23:08.420
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.420 --> 00:23:12.750
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:22.750
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:32.570
<i>This is Glaris.</i>

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:37.640
<i>Takius and Zephyrus, Iruga and Keough.</i>
<i>Who will sever the thread of fate?</i>

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:40.680
<i>And what happens when</i>
<i>Roan stands before Yuufa?</i>

00:23:40.680 --> 00:23:43.420
<i>Next time,</i> "One Who Realizes His Mistake."

00:23:43.420 --> 00:23:45.410
<i>Glast Heim is burning.</i>
